35023036265248_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IzZc2_i6iNUQ7kNvwE60LZT&_nc_oc=Adpp5txqUPSyH3YslcBn0aKb5-Rew9xqqCVeX7gHQJyf4NE6nmKF1NZ6JAj-D65cU7A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNpAdrvmflErTbr61TJb1sf7yU8Bfqw2LcConuipXh0rA&oe=6AC3B709"}, "display_name": "Attack on Slimes (2048 RPG)", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# Role Play Mode (2048 RPG):\nMerge blocks to create attack points. Then use it to defeat powerful creatures. But be careful they are getting stronger each wave. So you need to upgrade yourself. There is no end in this challenge.\n\n* Get Upgrades to improve your experience\n* Complete tasks to earn extra gold and claim achievements.\n* Access leaderboard and compete with others (crossplatform feature).\n\n# Normal 2048 Mode:\nMerge blocks to make points. Your goal is reaching best score as possible as you can.\n\n* 2048 is originally created by Gabriele Cirulli\n* Characters designed by Burak Ozturk\n* Developed by Sener Projects\n* Music and SFX provided by SwishSwoosh\n\n**WARNING:  VR dungeon game mode as a free update is coming soon! Meanwhile you can check out my other game \"Build the Future\".**", "short_description": "Brand new 2048 experience with RPG features."}]}, "developer_name": "SENER PROJECTS", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.senerprojects.com/games/attack-on-slimes/quest-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.senerprojects.com/games/attack-on-slimes/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "SENER PROJECTS", "support_website_url": "https://www.senerprojects.com/support", "website_url": "https://www.senerprojects.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "821934236779161"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "gen